{"reviewId": "35141733_80zYl6aFe", "review": {"abstract": "而人生的财富积累根本上源于资产价格的投资或投机，人生财富靠康波，康波就是人生的财富规划。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "所以说，世界是个巨大的草台班子，牛人很大一部分是时代给予的馈赠，并不是谁真的雄才大略。每个人都有自己的价值，永远不要因为别人而看轻自己。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "1251-1295", "createTime": 1748764133, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "35141733_80zYl6aFe", "userVid": 35141733, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 35141733, "name": "不二法师。", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTKexuZJbx6raplkrYS8dE466JUaSvmnDmROicC5ic7fj6Siaw7DNfsYtnsJ81AaswUVwhJrJiaKpOtIhA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-50", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 50}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 47, "likes": [{"userVid": 70638786, "name": "椰岛小鹿", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEL8SMR0XeXmKQr3JXzKqECqkt5hAibEK5fzrUMmHW6kXeM2Q0S6fK6JzcOOw6XV7bCZIZWBibcGAzvYDuB6D2RzqOs3yXibuicOYTiayNIyVXVoaRA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-3-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}], "commentsCount": 3, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"